.pipeline-logs/

# data
*.json
*.txt
# 평가셋·실행 기록·법령 원문은 커밋한다(ADR-014, HANDOFF, ADR-015·CR-010)
!eval/*.json
!results/**/*.json
!results/**/*.jsonl
!results/**/*.txt
